Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 20:17:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(nemesis-kit):=20round-26=20=E2=80=94=20nat?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ive=20view=20spill=20fix,=20ChatGPT=20source=20pills,=20on-devi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ce=20transcription=20upgrade,=20app=20icon?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Native browser view no longer spills over the chat. Root cause: bounds math
  was split across renderer (CSS px) + main (×zoomFactor), racing on a stale
  rect. Fix: renderer is the single source of truth — converts CSS→DIP with the
  live zoom and sends DIP; main applies verbatim (no scaling). Verified flush-
  right at 100/125/144% and across rapid Sources↔Browser toggles.
- Kill the show-flash: reveal-when-measured — the view is only setVisible(true)
  after a fresh, non-zero rect is pushed (rAF retry); garbage/zero rects are
  never sent; poll tightened 250→120ms; window-resize re-sends bounds.
- Secondary-window guard: setBounds/setVisible ignored unless from the host
  window (a second session window can't fight over the shared view).
- debugBounds IPC for harness verification (view.getBounds vs content vs rect).
- Source pills (Codex): inline pills now open the Sources rail and scroll+
  highlight the matching citation (new store source-focus.ts,
  focusSourceInRail) instead of popping the external browser; both inline pills
  and panel chips restyled ChatGPT-compact (shared SOURCE_CHIP_CLASS_NAME).
- Transcription accuracy: split models — live captions stay whisper-tiny.en
  (real-time), the SAVED transcript + Enhance use whisper-base.en (on-device,
  $0 COGS, materially more accurate). base model warms lazily.
- App icon: public/apple-touch-icon.png (the packaged bundle icon source) was
  still the old art — replaced with the Nemesis logo (md5 now matches assets).
